-#     program -- SANY, TLC, a behavioural check, a diff -- succeeds.
+#     program -- SANY, TLC, a behavioural check, a structural check, a diff --
+#     succeeds.
 #   * `exit 0`, ALWAYS. A Stop hook that fails non-zero can push the session
