+SI-04 worktree creation: the front door refused, the by-hand route was used.
+git-issue-workflow SKILL.md, "Reaching a by-hand route is itself a finding":
+this is the case "you found it and it FAILED", quoted verbatim.
+
+$ SMH="${SKILL_MANAGER_HOME:-$HOME/.skill-manager}"; test -x "$SMH/bin/cli/skt"   # -> present
+$ command -v skt
+/Users/hayde/.skill-manager/bin/cli/skt
+
+$ commit_oid=$(git rev-parse origin/epic/self-improvement-substrate)
+$ skt ticket new 337-improvement-record --base "$commit_oid" --path ../wt-337-improvement-record
+base=994f650c1b82dcc1851a9c1d51a1955efa4bc9a4
+  ! reconcile: no skill-manager projection for test-graph on claude at <wt>/.claude/skills/test-graph. In order to create all symlinks missing, please run: skill-manager sync
