+    A skill is served through <root>/.<agent>/skills/<unit>, not out of the
+    store. These are missing or resolve outside <wt>:
+      <wt>/.claude/skills/git-issue-workflow
+      <wt>/.codex/skills/git-issue-workflow
+      <wt>/.gemini/skills/git-issue-workflow
+      <wt>/.claude/skills/spec-double-compiler
